---
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Terms — Presently"
  description="Terms for using the Presently mobile application and website."
>
  <SiteHeader />
  <main class="legal-page">
    <article class="shell legal-content">
      <p class="legal-date">Last Updated July 27, 2026</p>
      <h1>Terms</h1>
      <p class="legal-intro">
        These terms apply when you use the Presently mobile application or this
        website. Presently is an independent client for the AT Protocol.
      </p>

      <h2>Your Account and Content</h2>
      <p>
        You are responsible for your account and for photos you choose to post.
        You keep ownership of your content. Posting through Presently publishes
        data to your AT Protocol repository under the rules of your account
        provider and the wider network.
      </p>

      <h2>Acceptable Use</h2>
      <p>
        Do not use Presently to violate the law, someone else’s rights, your
        account provider’s rules, or applicable network policies. Do not attempt
        to disrupt the app, its supporting services, or other users.
      </p>

      <h2>Story Expiration</h2>
      <p>
        The 24-hour story window controls how compatible apps display a post. It
        does not guarantee deletion from independently operated indexes, caches,
        archives, or repositories.
      </p>

      <h2>Beta Software</h2>
      <p>
        Presently may be provided as preview or beta software. Features can
        change, fail, or become unavailable. Keep your own copies of photos you
        do not want to lose.
      </p>

      <h2>No Warranty</h2>
      <p>
        Presently is provided “as is” to the extent permitted by law, without
        warranties of uninterrupted availability or fitness for a particular
        purpose.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        These terms may be updated as Presently evolves. The date above will
        change when a material revision is published.
      </p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>
        Visit <a href="/support/">Support</a> for the current way to contact the
        project.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</SiteLayout>
